**Plasm** — `logical_session_ref` + `program`. Policy-clean reads without fetch-all or fanout risk execute inline; mutations/review gates return `run_ref`. Inspect requirements, then call `plasm_run` with the ref, not the program.

Compose dependent reads, computation and effects in one Program; split when new evidence requires a decision or correction.

`program`: Python source, not JSON. Submit one Program subclass with build(self) and explicit return. Do not copy declarations, instantiate it or call build. Session declarations arrive through plasm_context; the language reference follows.

needs_fix: preserve selection criteria and repair the Python in the same logical session. Extend discovery only for missing capabilities.
